{"text": "The project is named Hermes, which is a re-naming of the Eudora eMail client for legal reasons.", "dimensions": ["objectives", "strategy", "feasibility"], "type": "market", "primary_dimension": "objectives", "meta": {"proposal_id": "kt13__openai", "chunk_index": 0, "char_start": 0, "char_end": 1800}}
